{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32597","headline":"浙江晚渡怀古 · 刘沧","name":"浙江晚渡怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉噪秋风满古堤，荻花寒渡思萋萋。\n潮声归海鸟初下，草色连江人自迷。\n碧落晴分平楚外，青山晚出穆陵西。\n此来一见垂纶者，却忆旧居明月溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}